{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Provide a supported way to disable default truncation**\n\nThe new default-limited exporters type this option as `int | None`, but use `None` to mean \u201capply the default,\u201d while the public `InsightExporter` contract says `None` disables truncation. Callers cannot express that documented behavior. Use a sentinel to distinguish omission from explicit `None`, or consistently document and test another disable value such as zero.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7uDuLX","finding_digest":"438dba5d5fbacb027d08059cf69ff0f29b1372669c53532aaa6782a2bba1abb2","finding_id":"arf_v1_iog3uxk7xlfqe7iiawopnh7q6k","finding_key":"insight/readme.md::max_record_size_bytes::none-disable-contract","identity_key":"insight/readme.md::max_record_size_bytes::none-disable-contract","line":77,"observation_digest":"27f38369d5349c718854100118295fbd020ef0a54461be5f3de85fae15dd5914","observation_id":"aro_v1_e7zyg2ovgsohdccucaarqkk7xu","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/README.md","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_iog3uxk7xlfqe7iiawopnh7q6k","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:40:34Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xt6uhdthxa7nsmucff7v6b6xfj","reviewed_base_sha":"8742ad9c9535e1de042963963c6b439f656894ce","reviewed_head_sha":"9b517c0ced071953adbd1e93e9660837dafb3e8d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":75,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_gd4ketupu4pjqw4mxxgu2c7z65","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:40:34Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
